<title>UK: Shield Diagnostics suffers six months loss.</title>
<headline>Shield Diagnostics suffers six months loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	   1.56		 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    --		  vs    --</p>
<p> Pretax loss		  0.29		 vs   0.04 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		     2.73		 vs   2.73</p>
<p> Interest receivable    0.03		   vs  0.04</p>
<p> Tax			  *			vs  0.01</p>
<p>Note: The British drug manufacturer said its operating expenses increased to 1.53 million stg in the current year from 402,800 stg as part of its decision to give priority to internal research and development. This was one of the main reasons for the firm to report an operating loss, it said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542-7717</p>
